Tuhat.

00:40:28.000 --> 00:40:29.000
Viimane pakkumine.

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:33.000
Dean, mul on juriidiline kohustus.

00:40:33.000 --> 00:40:37.000
Jennifer Peterson vajab minu kaitset.

00:40:38.000 --> 00:40:40.000
Kuidas ma saan teda hüljata?

