00:48:15.000 --> 00:48:18.000
Dean Ericson, teie ausus.
Need on mu kolleegid.

00:48:18.000 --> 00:48:21.000
Me esindame Jennifer Petersoni huve

00:48:21.000 --> 00:48:23.000
